                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 56 }}>P0</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>PDF / Word 解析入库；评测集瑕疵复核（q018 禁词、q020 标注）</Text>
