                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>企微 OAuth + 组织架构同步；bge-reranker 接入</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>约 3 天</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 78, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 56 }}>P2</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>答不出 → 生成待办并通知；企微 H5 / 侧边栏</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>约 5 天</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 78 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 56 }}>P3</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>万级文档压测；高可用与多活</Text>
